    "MissionGiver": "Dead Saints",
    "Title": "Cleaning Up Someone Else\u2019s Mess",
    "TitleKey": "DeadSaints_RecoverCargo_Easy_Title",
    "Description": "You know when you ask someone a question and you have a feeling they\u2019re lying, but you choose to give them the benefit of the doubt? Yeah. That\u2019s what I\u2019m dealing with right now.\n\nTwo \u201cexpert\u201d haulers I hired to transport some gear for me ran into some trouble and ended up ditching my goods over at <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4>. Needless to say, I\u2019ve ordered a hit on them, but what I need from you is to go recover that cargo. The tracker says the cargo\u2019s still on the ship, so you\u2019ll just need a <EM4>a heavy-duty tractor beam</EM4> and your own ship to recover it.\n\nYou might run into a couple of scavengers lurking around there, but I doubt you\u2019ll have any trouble with them.\n\nWhen you\u2019re done, take the stuff to <EM4>~mission(Destination|Address)</EM4> and I\u2019ll sort you out with a reward.\n\n-Twitch",
    "DescriptionKey": "DeadSaints_RecoverCargo_Easy_Description",
    "DisplayDescription": "You know when you ask someone a question and you have a feeling they\u2019re lying, but you choose to give them the benefit of the doubt? Yeah. That\u2019s what I\u2019m dealing with right now.\n\nTwo \u201cexpert\u201d haulers I hired to transport some gear for me ran into some trouble and ended up ditching my goods over at <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4>. Needless to say, I\u2019ve ordered a hit on them, but what I need from you is to go recover that cargo. The tracker says the cargo\u2019s still on the ship, so you\u2019ll just need a <EM4>a heavy-duty tractor beam</EM4> and your own ship to recover it.\n\nYou might run into a couple of scavengers lurking around there, but I doubt you\u2019ll have any trouble with them.\n\nWhen you\u2019re done, take the stuff to <EM4>[Destination|Address]</EM4> and I\u2019ll sort you out with a reward.\n\n-Twitch",
